<view class="page">

  <block wx:if="{{phase === 'input' || phase === 'error'}}">
    <view class="card">
      <view class="title">解锁设备</view>
      <view class="desc muted">
        输入主密码完成认证。认证后 30 秒内可执行一次密码输出操作。
      </view>

      <input class="input" password="{{!showPwd}}" placeholder="主密码"
             value="{{pwd}}" bindinput="onInput" maxlength="64"
             confirm-type="go" bindconfirm="onUnlock" />

      <view class="row">
        <text class="label">显示密码</text>
        <switch checked="{{showPwd}}" bindchange="toggleShow" color="#2563eb" />
      </view>

      <view wx:if="{{err}}" class="err-box">{{err}}</view>

      <button class="btn btn-primary" bindtap="onUnlock"
              disabled="{{!pwd || phase === 'computing'}}">解锁</button>
    </view>

    <view class="hint muted">
      连续输错 3 次锁定 30 秒 / 6 次锁定 5 分钟 / 10 次永久锁定。<br/>
      忘记主密码：请用恢复码重置（会清空全部密码）。
    </view>
  </block>

  <block wx:elif="{{phase === 'computing'}}">
    <view class="card center-card">
      <view class="spin">🔐</view>
      <view class="title">正在验证密钥…</view>
      <view class="muted" style="margin-top:8rpx;">{{progress}}%</view>
      <view class="progress-wrap">
        <view class="progress-bar" style="width:{{progress}}%"></view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </block>

</view>
